  "id": "sexual-dysfunction",
  "term": "sexual dysfunction",
  "definition": "Sexual dysfunction is a clinically significant problem in sexual functioning that can affect quality of life, intimate relationships, self-esteem, and staying with treatment. In psychiatric care, it may exist before medication or emerge during treatment, so it is important to distinguish illness-related difficulties from medication-associated impairment.",
